Package: dmai
Type: Package
Title: Divisia Monetary Aggregates Index
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-05
Authors@R: c(
      person("Muhammad", "Yaseen", email = "myaseen208@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5923-1714"))
    , person("Ahmad", "Nadeem", email = "Ahmed.Nadeem@sbp.org.pk", role = c("aut", "ctb"))
    )
Description: Builds monetary aggregates from their components by the methods
    of index number theory. The Divisia index of Barnett (1980)
    <doi:10.1016/0304-4076(80)90070-6> weights every component (currency,
    demand deposits, savings and time deposits, ...) by its share in the
    expenditure on monetary services, priced by its user cost (Barnett 1978)
    <doi:10.1016/0165-1765(78)90051-4>. Also gives the Fisher ideal index, a
    variant with simple growth rates, the simple-sum aggregate, the currency
    equivalent index of Rotemberg, Driscoll and Poterba (1995), the dual
    user-cost price index and the Divisia second moments of Barnett and
    Serletis (1990) <doi:10.1016/0304-4076(90)90104-2>; benchmark rates
    given or taken from the components (upper envelope); 'ggplot2'
    graphics, a plain-language interpretation of every result and a built-in
    'shiny' application.
